      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just ran into this same issue, version 2025.3.3.\n\nI am using Quest Pro + Index Controllers and Virtual Desktop.\n\nIndex controller fingers render correctly in the local view, so the client is definitely getting the tracking information from the controllers, but nobody else in the instance could see my fingers moving; all they got were the static quest-gesture approximations.\n\nSwitching to a different avatar and then back to force everyone to re-load my avatar seems to fix it. As soon as I leave the instance and re-join, however, it breaks again until I do another avatar swap.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
